      "statement": "A product's Web UI and MCP companion are gated behind its parent core PASS, a companion PASS can never substitute for a failed parent, and companion tests avoid importing new dependencies by using the runner's own MCP client and the application's direct LAN endpoint rather than HX-15 FastMCP or HX-7 NGINX.",
